                                  "fill": "#1e2532",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 126.63,
                                  "content": "The web app is live at cyclebridge.app. A mobile app is in the works and will be released soon, along with a companion Garmin app so your data flows straight from the handlebars to CycleBridge — no manual exports, no detours.",
